Description: Linux command lookup tools for terminal and desktop
 A suite of two Bash command-line utilities and a Python/Tkinter desktop app
 for looking up installed commands and accessing their reference material.
 le-bash provides a prompt-driven command inspector. linux-explorer offers
 an interactive terminal menu and command search. le-py provides a desktop
 interface with PATH completion, reference views, and binary metadata.
